special_abilities:
  - name: "Full Conversion Dragon Body"
    description: "The AT-C12000 Flame Cloud, a full conversion cyborg for heavy air assault, built like a serpent or true dragon rather than a humanoid; 24 feet (7.2 m) from head to tail, 5 feet (1.5 m) tall on all fours or 9 feet (2.7 m) rearing on its hind legs, about 1500 lbs (675 kg). Physical attributes equal P.S. 24, P.P. 22, Spd 176 (stored). M.D.C. by location: hands/feet (2) 20 each*, forelegs/arms (2) 50 each, hind legs (2) 50 each, laser guns (2) 50 each, prehensile tail 50 per 6 ft (1.8 m) of length*, jet thrusters (2, on the sides) 120 each, tail particle beam cannons (2) 70 each*, head 100 (reinforced)*, main body 320 (stored). Armor is built in: it cannot wear additional body armor. * A called shot at -3 is needed to hit these small targets; destroying the head kills the character. Depleting the main body destroys the artificial body, but emergency systems keep the brain alive for 36 hours, long enough to be recovered and placed on life support until a new body is fitted; 125 points below zero destroys it beyond recovery. Nuclear power supply, average life 20 years."
  - name: "Jet Thruster Flight"
