  - name: "Flame Cloud Combat Bonuses"
    description: "Stored: +1 attack per melee (includes the tail), +1 initiative, +1 parry, +1 dodge, +2 pull punch, +2 save vs Horror Factor. In the air only: +2 initiative in place of +1, and +2 dodge in place of +1 when flying below cruising speed. The book adds the P.P. 23 bonus of +4 to strike, parry and dodge, which is the attribute bonus of the stored P.P. and is not stored again. Physical strength is S.D.C. except for special attacks. Damage: restrained punch 1D6+13 S.D.C., full strength punch 3D6+13 S.D.C., power punch 1D4 M.D. (two attacks), head butt 2D6 S.D.C., kick 4D6+13 S.D.C., jump kick or leap attack 2D4 M.D. (two attacks), judo-style throw or flip 3D6 S.D.C., full speed ram or body block 1D4 M.D. (two attacks)."
  - name: "Flame Breath Plasma System"
