  - name: "Thruster Laser Guns"
    description: "Two anti-aircraft and anti-armor lasers mounted on the jet thrusters, firing from the sides of the exhaust. 4D6 M.D. per blast; range 4000 feet (1200 m); rate of fire equal to hand to hand attacks; payload effectively unlimited."
  - name: "Tail Double Particle Beam Cannon"
    description: "Two particle beam cannons on the rear sides of the tail, able to rotate to aim in any direction. A single blast does 4D6 M.D.; a double blast 1D4x10+10 M.D. Range 4000 feet (1200 m); rate of fire equal to hand to hand attacks; payload effectively unlimited."
  - name: "Vibro-Claws and Vibro-Tail"
    description: "The forelegs, hind legs and tail tip are all tipped with vibro-blades, 3D6 M.D. per attack. The prehensile tail can feel around narrow openings, grab small objects, slash, parry or entangle; a blunt tail strike does 6D6 S.D.C., half when restrained."
  - name: "Standard Bionic Features"
